## 1. customerCode — building, format, sequence numbers

**`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/function/owner/AssignOwnerCustomerCode.java`**

Format is `<CITY3>-<LAST3>-<NNNN>` where NNNN is a per-city 4-digit zero-padded sequence = (owners already in that city) + 1.

